    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you say it's not my fault but it feels like it is. every time i try to fix things i just make it worse for them. they look so tired of me. i just feel like i'm constantly dragging them down into the mud with me. it feels like the only thing i'm actually good for is being a problem that needs solving.",
